    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Touches the conditions that decide whether a Decision Record counts as server-written (idempotent replay, gate records, condition-cleared records, billing reads, the read route): a wrong condition replays a forged record or misses a real one.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>deferred-fixes-2026-11-25d</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>DecisionRecordWriter.cs, DecisionCommitService.cs, SignalReadService.cs, GateDecisionRecordSharing.cs, one site in SignalReevaluationJob.cs (~962) and the ArchTest baseline; task 224 edits a different method of SignalReevaluationJob.cs (deleted-rule redaction): merge master before merging if 224 lands first.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>none</deps>
