  <completion>Done 2026-11-25: PR #3167 squash-merged to master (feef9a9c72), closes #2632 (DI-144). Every Signals lookup that trusts a Decision Record as the writer's now requires createdby = writer AND createdonbehalfby empty through WriterCreatedRecord: DecisionCommitService.FindRecordAsync, DecisionRecordWriter.FindGateRecordAsync / FindConditionClearedRecordAsync / AddWriterFilterAsync (also the Procedure and many-subject lookups), SignalReevaluationJob.RetriesReplacingAPriorLinkAsync, the SignalReadService FetchXML (FetchXmlFilter nested in the root and-filter), and GateDecisionRecordSharing.FindGateRecordsAsync in memory (column added, required empty, kept local with a comment). WriterCreatedRecordSingleSourceGuardTests Baseline is empty; WriterCreatedRecord.cs unchanged. Tests: 7 new, one per family, each failing with its own site's condition removed (reviewer per-site mutations); changed existing tests justified in the PR (gate condition count, re-evaluation fake null semantics, ebilling InvoiceApprovalCompletionTests K3 now reached by a concurrent-approve race, RecordProcedure_W4 pinned list), ebilling-r1 approved both of theirs. Independent Opus adversarial review: production correct at all seven sites; F2 fixed (stale K3 comments in InvoiceApprovalService.cs now describe the concurrent-approve race; code name kept, ebilling approved the wording); K1 read-route fake nesting check and K2 RuleSetService draft cleanup (out of scope) in notes/task-223-notes.md. Master merged after #3164 with no conflicts; re-run: unit Signals|WriterCreatedRecord|Finance 15,141 pass, integration Signals 199 pass, guard 15 pass; full ArchTests 2,831 pass; publish size -78 bytes. Defence in depth, no dev behaviour change expected (96 of 96 dev Decision Records have createdonbehalfby empty); reaches dev with the next uac-r2 candidate.</completion>
